  "description": "The Spitfire V3.2 is designed from the ground up to be an incredibly rewarding and fun trail bike.\nThe suspension kinematics are tuned to provide great mid-stroke support, with pleasing progression deep in the travel. This provides great trail feedback, and response enabling you to carve tighter turns while the frame stiffness helps you easily hold high lines over rocks and roots. We love the Spitfire for its ability to thrive when you pick good lines and man-handle it around the trail. For many, (us included) this is what riding really is about. Adding incredible pedal efficiency, rider optimized weight distribution and ergonomics…the Spitfire is a real riders favorite.\nRefined utilizing the KS2 linkage, and a sporty 135mm of rear wheel travel the Spitfire V3.2 is all about nimble, playful trail charging fun!",
